  "published": "2026-11-16T11:07:11.923Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "4.0.1 — maintenance release with no public API or wire-format changes. Updates the package dependencies Microsoft.Extensions.Http and Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions to 10.0.15 and Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience to 10.11.0, staying on the 10.x line that matches the net10.0 target. Repository builds move to .NET SDK 10.0.404, which brings the Native AOT toolchain packages to 10.0.15 and resolves the GHSA-p3jp-9v83-76w9 dependency-audit failure; that advisory concerns the .NET Native AOT toolchain and runtime packs, which are not part of the SolSharp package. Test tooling, analyzers, pinned CI actions, and the solution, benchmark, and packed AOT locks are synchronized. Verified with the offline test suite, package API validation against 4.0.0, and packed Native AOT smoke checks. 4.0.0 recap — V1 transactions by default: HTTP transaction/block reads and WebSocket block subscriptions advertise transaction version 1, and full configuration objects default MaxSupportedTransactionVersion to 1. Use explicit version 0 to retain legacy/v0-only reads, or null in full options to omit the version field; base58/binary encodings require an explicit version 0 or null. Full details: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/v4.0.1/CHANGELOG.md",
